PROMPT 11 — UMAMI ANALYTICS
================================================================================

Umami is self-hosted analytics. No data goes to
Google. Privacy-first.

CREATE: qay/components/UmamiScript.tsx

'use client'

Inject Umami tracking script on ALL published pages.
Our site renderer wrapper adds this.

export function UmamiScript() {
  const websiteId = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID
  const scriptUrl = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL

  if (!websiteId || !scriptUrl) return null

  return (
    <script
      async
      defer
      data-website-id={websiteId}
      src={`${scriptUrl}/script.js`}
    />
  )
}

Add to: app/(qay)/layout.tsx (our layouts)
AND: inject into published site pages via our site wrapper.

SELF-HOSTED UMAMI SETUP:
Add to README.qay.md:

Deploy Umami on Railway (free tier):
1. railway.app → New Project → Deploy from GitHub
2. Use: github.com/umami-software/umami
3. Add PostgreSQL database
4. Set UMAMI_APP_SECRET in Railway env
5. Get your script URL: https://your-umami.railway.app
6. Create website in Umami dashboard → get website ID
7. Add to .env: NEXT_PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID + NEXT_PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL

